msgid "GivePayments"
msgstr "GivePayments"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: woocommerce-givepayments.php
msgid "https://givepayments.com"
msgstr "https://givepayments.com"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:16
msgid "Accept payments using GivePayments."
msgstr "使用 GivePayments 接受付款."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:18
msgid "Pay with Credit and Debit Cards"
msgstr "使用信用卡和借记卡付款"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:20
msgid "Pay securely via GivePayments"
msgstr "通过 GivePayments 安全支付"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:43
msgid "General Info"
msgstr "基本信息"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:46
msgid ""
"Enable or disable GivePayments gateway, configure your activation keys,\n"
"                                        and activate test mode to simulate "
"transactions.\n"
"                                        Need help? Check out our detailed "
"documentation for guidance"
msgstr ""
"启用或禁用 GivePayments 支付网关，配置您的激活密钥，并启用测试模式来模拟交"
"易。需要帮助？请查看我们的详细文档以获取指导"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:50
msgid "View GivePayments Docs"
msgstr "查看 GivePayments 文档"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:58
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "启用/禁用"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:60
msgid "Enable GivePayments on Checkout"
msgstr "在结账时启用 GivePayments"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:64
msgid "Payment Title"
msgstr "支付标题"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:66
msgid "Payment method title shown at checkout."
msgstr "结账时显示的支付方式标题."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:71
msgid "Payment Description"
msgstr "支付描述"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:73
msgid "Payment method description shown at checkout."
msgstr "结账时显示的支付方式描述."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:74
msgid "Pay with credit and debit cards"
msgstr "使用信用卡和借记卡支付"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:78
msgid "Order Status"
msgstr "订单状态"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:81
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "已完成"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:82
msgid "Processing"
msgstr "处理中"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:84
msgid ""
"Select order status for the WooCommerce order after the transaction is "
"captured on GivePayments"
msgstr "选择 WooCommerce 订单的状态，当交易在 GivePayments 记录后"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:86
msgid ""
"The payment title will be visible on the checkout page when the user selects "
"the payment method."
msgstr "用户选择支付方式时，支付标题将在结账页面显示."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:90
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "环境"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:93
msgid "Sandbox (Testing)"
msgstr "沙盒（测试）"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:94
msgid "Production"
msgstr "生产环境"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:96
msgid "Select environment for the payments"
msgstr "选择支付环境"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:98
msgid ""
"Test Mode allows you to test transactions and purchases before switching to "
"Production. Please ensure to use the correct API keys for your selected "
"environment"
msgstr ""
"测试模式允许您在切换到生产环境之前测试交易和购买。请确保使用所选环境的正确 "
"API 密钥"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:102
msgid "Production API Key"
msgstr "生产环境 API 密钥"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:105
msgid "Enter your API key for production use."
msgstr "输入您的生产环境 API 密钥."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:110
msgid "Merchant ID"
msgstr "商户 ID"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:113
msgid "Enter your Merchant ID"
msgstr "输入您的商户 ID"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:118
#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:120
msgid "Connection Test"
msgstr "连接测试"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:124
msgid ""
"Click this button to verify the connection. If successful, your site will be "
"linked to GivePayments after entering the correct keys. The results below "
"indicate the status of your connection, processing, and transfer "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"点击此按钮验证连接。如果成功，您的网站将在输入正确的密钥后连接到 "
"GivePayments。下方的结果显示您的连接状态、处理情况和转账能力."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:131
msgid "GivePayment Merchant Portal"
msgstr "GivePayments 商户门户"
